        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "871f1c08-b248-5c30-a654-1bdf6dad2a75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Danie Visser, Oliver Marach, Rick Leach, Jim Pugh, Grant Connell, Glenn Michibata, Pieter Aldrich\n- Events: 1990 Australian Open – Men's Doubles\n- Organizations: ATP Masters Series\n- Concepts: Grand Slam men's doubles titles, doubles rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Danie Visser was a doubles specialist who won three Grand Slam men's doubles titles, including two Australian Open titles and one US Open title.\n- The ATP Masters Series tournaments were the most prestigious events in men's tennis after the four Grand Slam events and were important for the top male players on the professional circuit.\n- On October 18, 2010, Oliver Marach reached his career-high doubles ranking of world No. 8.\n- At the 1990 Australian Open – Men's Doubles, Rick Leach and Jim Pugh were the defending champions, but Grant Connell and Glenn Michibata defeated them in the semifinals.\n- At the 1990 Australian Open – Men's Doubles, Pieter Aldrich and Danie Visser won the title by defeating Grant Connell and Glenn Michibata 6–4, 4–6, 6–1, 6–4 in the final.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b40ea6ac-a97a-5c43-8eb7-f8e05f5b04c6",
        "text": "Page: Danie Visser. Sentence: A doubles specialist, he won 3 Grand Slam men's doubles titles (2 Australian Open and 1 US Open).\nPage: Oliver Marach. Sentence: His career high in doubles is world No. 8, set on October 18, 2010.\nPage: 1990 Australian Open – Men's Doubles. Sentence: Rick Leach and Jim Pugh were the defending champions, but lost in the semifinals to Grant Connell and Glenn Michibata.\nPage: 1990 Australian Open – Men's Doubles. Sentence: Pieter Aldrich and Danie Visser won the title, defeating Connell and Michibata 6–4, 4–6, 6–1, 6–4, in the final.\nPage: ATP Masters Series. Sentence: The tournaments were important for the top male players on the professional circuit as the series constituted the most prestigious tournaments in men's tennis after the four Grand Slam events.",
